    "text": "hubcityradio.com\nwebsite\nAberdeen\nAberdeen City workers approve union vote\nBy KSDN News,13 hours ago\nABERDEEN, S.D.(Press Release)— City workers in Aberdeen have made history by winning their union election on a 79-29 vote, uniting across departments in a shared effort to secure fair wages, equal benefits, and a genuine voice on the job. But while employees came together in solidarity, the City of Aberdeen chose a different path, spending taxpayer money to hire a New York-based union-busting law firm in an unsuccessful attempt to stop them.\n3\nComments\nLoading editor...",
